        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellie Goulding, Ed Sheeran\n- Songs: \"On My Mind\", \"Don't\"\n- Albums: Delirium, ×\n- Topics: answer songs, critical interpretation\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Ed Sheeran recorded the song \"Don't\" for his second studio album, ×.\n- In 2015, Ellie Goulding released \"On My Mind\" as a song from her third studio album, Delirium.\n- Many critics considered Ellie Goulding's \"On My Mind\" to be an answer song to Ed Sheeran's \"Don't,\" although Goulding firmly denied that interpretation.",
